"TARGET: the loudness standard of the current mode. The gauge, delta, history band and VU meter read against it. Stereo and Immersive each keep their own and follow the mode." = "目標：目前模式的響度標準。響度條、差值、歷史目標帶與 VU 表都以它為基準。立體聲與沉浸聲各自保存一套，並隨模式切換。";
