"Each insert measures its own audio inside the DAW; Auraliscope shows its results. The plugin window's button also chooses its insert here." = "每個插入實例在 DAW 內測量自己的音訊，Auraliscope 顯示其結果。外掛視窗中的按鈕也可以在這裡選擇該插入實例。";
