"The levels the spectrogram's colors span. Standard: −90 to −12 dBFS. Deep: −114 to −24 dBFS, for reverb tails, noise floors and hum. Hot: −72 to 0 dBFS, for loud masters." = "聲譜圖顏色涵蓋的電平範圍。標準：−90 至 −12 dBFS。低電平：−114 至 −24 dBFS，適合觀察殘響尾音、底噪和交流哼聲。高電平：−72 至 0 dBFS，適合響亮的母帶。";
