"How quickly the live spectrum follows the sound. Fast shows every attack; Slow steadies the curve so tonal balance is easy to read. Peak holds and the average are unaffected." = "即時頻譜跟隨聲音的快慢。快顯示每一次起音；慢讓曲線更穩定，便於判斷音色平衡。峰值保持和平均值不受影響。";
"Colors" = "配色";
"Theme" = "主題";
"Heat" = "熱度";
"Gray" = "灰階";
"The spectrogram's color map. Theme follows the app's palette. Heat turns from indigo through crimson to amber as the level rises, so nearby levels are easier to tell apart. Gray is plain grayscale." = "聲譜圖的配色。主題依照 App 的調色盤。熱度隨電平升高由靛藍經深紅變為琥珀色，相近的電平更容易區分。灰階為純黑白。";
"A display slope around 1 kHz for the spectrum and the spectrogram. Music falls by about 3 to 4.5 dB per octave, so a tilt shows a balanced mix as level and the treble as clearly as the bass. Readings stay true." = "以 1 kHz 為支點，為頻譜和聲譜圖加上顯示斜率。音樂的能量通常每八度下降約 3 到 4.5 dB，加上斜率後，平衡的混音會顯示得大致水平，高頻細節也和低頻一樣清楚。讀數保持真實值。";
"Hover over the spectrogram or the spectrum to read its pitch, frequency and level; pause to read a moment at leisure." = "將指標停留在聲譜圖或頻譜上即可讀取音高、頻率和電平；暫停後可從容查看某一時刻。";
"avg" = "平均";
