"A second line averages received spectrum measurements in power, leaving out silence. Reset, a source or sample-rate change, or switching between Stereo and Immersive starts a new average." = "第二條曲線對接收到的頻譜測量值進行功率平均，忽略靜音。重置、更換音源或取樣率，以及在立體聲與沉浸聲之間切換時，將重新開始平均。";
"Spectrogram span" = "聲譜圖時長";
"How many seconds the spectrogram shows. Auto fits 3 to 8 s to the panel's width; 15 s shows a whole phrase." = "聲譜圖顯示的時長。自動會按面板寬度顯示 3 到 8 秒；15 秒可看到完整的樂句。";
"Copy Spectrogram Image" = "拷貝聲譜圖影像";
