"Classic" = "經典";
"Enhanced" = "增強";
"Smoothing" = "平滑";
"reassigned" = "重新分配";
"2D scrolls a flat image in time. 3D lifts it into a landscape: time across, frequency into the distance, level as height." = "2D 以平面影像隨時間捲動。3D 將其立成地形：橫向為時間，縱深為頻率，高度為電平。";
"A faint line along each band's recent peak, held 1.2 s and then falling." = "沿每個頻段最近的峰值畫一條淡線，保持 1.2 秒後回落。";
"Averages the curve, the peak holds and the average across frequency, in power. 1/6 octave reads like a mixing engineer's analyser; 1/3 octave shows the broad tonal balance; Off draws every band. Var keeps 1/48 octave detail up to 100 Hz and widens to 1/3 octave from 10 kHz, as room-measurement software does." = "在頻率方向上按功率平均曲線、峰值保持和平均曲線。1/6 八度接近混音工程師常用的分析儀；1/3 八度顯示整體音色平衡；關閉則繪製每個頻段。Var 在 100 Hz 以下保留 1/48 八度的細節，並在 10 kHz 以上放寬到 1/3 八度，與房間測量軟體的做法相同。";
"Classic shows every row at its calibrated level. Enhanced moves each component's energy to the time and frequency its phase points to (reassignment): tones become thin lines and onsets sharp, while noise breaks into fine grain." = "經典模式按校準電平顯示每一行。增強模式依據相位把每個成分的能量移到其所在的時間與頻率（時頻重新分配）：音調成為細線，起音更清晰，噪聲則呈細碎顆粒。";
"How finely the correlation splits the spectrum: the full band, three bands or five." = "相關性劃分頻譜的精細程度：全頻段、三個頻段或五個頻段。";
"This plugin sends Classic columns. Install the plugins of this build for Enhanced." = "此外掛傳送的是經典模式資料。若要使用增強模式，請安裝本版本的外掛。";

