/* Build 80: the Immersive nebula. */
"ANALYSIS" = "分析";
"Analysis and motion" = "分析與動態";
"Attack" = "起音";
"Axes" = "座標軸";
"Coherence sensitivity" = "相干靈敏度";
"Dome orbits: drag across to turn it, up or down to raise or lower the camera. Front looks ahead from behind the listener, Top from above, Side from the right, Iso from an isometric corner; dragging in Front, Top or Iso carries on from there. Scroll or pinch to zoom; double-click to return to the default view." = "穹頂視圖可環繞：左右拖移旋轉，上下拖移升降視角。前置視角從聽者身後向前看，俯視從上方，側視從右側，等軸從等軸測的角度；在前置、俯視或等軸視角中拖移，會從該視角繼續環繞。捲動或雙指捏合可縮放；按兩下回到預設視角。";
"Frequencies above are not drawn." = "高於此頻率的部分不繪製。";
"Frequencies below are not drawn." = "低於此頻率的部分不繪製。";
"Front view" = "前置視角";
"Grid" = "格線";
"Highest frequency" = "最高頻率";
"How close the camera is to the listener. Also with the scroll wheel or a pinch over the dome." = "相機與聽者的距離。也可在穹頂上捲動滾輪或雙指捏合。";
"How long a faint afterglow of recent energy lingers after the release; 0 turns it off." = "釋放之後，近期能量的淡淡餘輝停留多久；0 表示關閉。";
"How much of each image's predicted width is drawn: 1 as wide as it is heard, from its energy vector after Frank 2013 (an in-phase phantom between speakers 60° apart about 36°, one speaker 10.7°), 0 every image as compact as one speaker, 2 twice as wide. Energy that cancels between speakers spreads wider still." = "繪製每個聲像預測寬度的多少：1 按其被聽到的寬度繪製，依據 Frank 2013 由能量向量求得（相距 60° 的兩支揚聲器之間的同相幻象約 36°，單支揚聲器為 10.7°）；0 將每個聲像畫得與單支揚聲器一樣緊湊；2 畫成兩倍寬。在揚聲器之間相互抵消的能量鋪展得更寬。";
"How readily speakers that share coherent energy form one image between them. Coherence is measured from the speakers' smoothed cross-spectra and corrected for chance; higher sensitivity lets weaker coherence form images, lower keeps only strongly shared signals together. The analysis uses it (in the plugin, too)." = "共享相干能量的揚聲器之間形成同一聲像的難易程度。相干度由揚聲器的平滑互譜測得，並校正了偶然相關；靈敏度越高，較弱的相干也能成像，越低則只有強烈共享的訊號才會合在一起。分析過程會使用此設定（外掛中也是）。";
"Iso" = "等軸";
"Isometric view" = "等軸視角";
"Lowest frequency" = "最低頻率";
"MOTION" = "動態";
"Opacity" = "不透明度";
"Persistence" = "餘輝";
"Phantom" = "幻象聲像";
"Release" = "釋放";
"Restore defaults" = "恢復預設值";
"Show LFE" = "顯示 LFE";
"Side" = "側視";
"Spatial spread" = "空間擴散";
"Speakers" = "揚聲器";
"The speakers' positions and names." = "揚聲器的位置與名稱。";
"This plugin sends no spatial field, so the nebula shows each channel's band energy at its speaker only. Install the plugins of this build for coherent images." = "此外掛不傳送空間場，因此星雲只在各揚聲器處顯示各聲道的頻段能量。請安裝本版本的外掛以顯示相干聲像。";
