"coherence %.2f" = "相干 %.2f";
"in phase %d%%" = "同相 %d%%";
"x to the right, y to the front, z up, from the listener." = "從聽者出發：x 向右，y 向前，z 向上。";
"FREQUENCY" = "頻率";
"%@ to 0 dBFS" = "%@ 至 0 dBFS";
"RADIUS = LEVEL" = "半徑 = 電平";
"Radius = level, %@ to 0 dBFS" = "半徑 = 電平，%@ 至 0 dBFS";
"Level floor" = "電平下限";
"How much the body covers what lies behind it." = "能量體遮蓋其後方內容的程度。";
"How quickly the body grows toward a new level." = "能量體向新電平擴張的速度。";
"How quickly the body shrinks when the level drops." = "電平下降時能量體收縮的速度。";
"How much every lobe is widened beyond the width it is predicted to be heard at, so the body reads as one mass (degrees at half maximum). At 30°, two uncorrelated speakers 60° apart still show as two lobes, while one coherent image between them shows as one." = "每個波瓣在預測的聽感寬度之外再加寬多少，使能量體讀作一個整體（半峰全寬，單位為度）。在 30° 時，相距 60° 的兩支不相關揚聲器仍顯示為兩個波瓣，而它們之間的一個相干聲像顯示為一個波瓣。";
"The LFE channel's level as the arc around the listener, on the body's scale: it has no direction, so it never shapes the body. Low frequencies in the full-range channels stay where those channels are." = "LFE 聲道的電平顯示為聽者周圍的弧線，與能量體同一刻度：它沒有方向，因此從不改變能量體的形狀。全頻聲道中的低頻仍留在這些聲道所在的位置。";
"The hemisphere's grid and the level rings on the floor, every 20 dB, labelled in dBFS." = "半球格線與地面上的電平環，每 20 dB 一環，以 dBFS 標示。";
"The level at the listener, where the body's radius starts: quieter energy reaches no radius. The speakers' shell is 0 dBFS." = "聽者處的電平，即能量體半徑的起點：更安靜的能量不形成半徑。揚聲器所在的球殼為 0 dBFS。";
"Frequency" = "頻率";
"Frequency colors the full band by the bands heard from each direction, warm bass through cool treble: near the listener every audible band mixes, toward white for broadband sound, and toward the edge only the loudest bands remain. Theme draws it in the palette's color. A split into 3 or 5 bands always shows each band in its own color." = "「頻率」按每個方向聽到的各頻段為全頻段著色，低音偏暖、高音偏冷：靠近聽者處所有可聞頻段相互混合，寬頻聲音趨近白色；越靠近邊緣，只剩下最響的頻段。「主題」使用調色盤的顏色。分為 3 或 5 個頻段時，每個頻段始終以自身的顏色顯示。";
