"All readings cover the whole file. Tonal balance, bandwidth and stereo image use the meter's spectrum (128 bands, about 1/13 octave) and its five stereo bands, averaged in power over the moments with sound. DC offset and the energy below 20 Hz come from a signal-health meter in the analysis: each channel's 1 s mean, and a fourth-order 20 Hz low-pass after the drift is removed." = "所有讀數涵蓋整個檔案。音色平衡、頻寬與立體聲像使用本表的頻譜（128 個頻帶，約 1/13 八度）及其五個立體聲頻帶，在有聲音的時刻按功率平均。直流偏移與 20 Hz 以下的能量來自分析中的訊號健康測量：各聲道 1 秒均值，以及去除漂移後的四階 20 Hz 低通。";
