"Measured offline from the whole file at its own sample rate, with the same analysis and 10 Hz readings as live metering." = "離線測量整個檔案，使用其原始取樣率，分析與 10 Hz 讀數與即時測量相同。";
"Measures a whole file — WAV, AIFF, MP3, AAC, ALAC, FLAC and more — with the meter's own analysis, then writes the loudness and master report as a PDF. The file stays on your Mac." = "用本表本身的分析測量整個檔案（WAV、AIFF、MP3、AAC、ALAC、FLAC 等），然後產生 PDF 格式的響度與母帶報告。檔案始終留在你的 Mac 上。";
