"Audio MIDI Setup (%@)" = "音訊 MIDI 設定（%@）";
"Audio MIDI Setup sets this device's speakers up as %@: unless you route them here, its channels feed those speakers." = "「音訊 MIDI 設定」將此裝置的揚聲器設定為 %@：除非在這裡另行路由，它的各聲道就送往這些揚聲器。";
