"No speakers are set up for this device in Audio MIDI Setup, so input 1 feeds the first channel in SMPTE order, input 2 the second, and so on. Set them up there (Configure Speakers), or choose a Channel Order." = "此裝置未在「音訊 MIDI 設定」中設定揚聲器，因此按 SMPTE 順序，輸入 1 對應第一個聲道，輸入 2 對應第二個，依此類推。可在那裡設定（「設定揚聲器」），或選擇一種聲道順序。";
"Pro Tools sends surround in film order (L C R Ls Rs LFE…), not in SMPTE order (L R C LFE Ls Rs…): with SMPTE order its surrounds are shown at the front. Set its speakers up in Audio MIDI Setup or choose Channel Order ▸ Film Order, unless its I/O Setup is remapped, and the format that matches its output bus." = "Pro Tools 以電影順序（L C R Ls Rs LFE…）輸出環繞聲，而不是 SMPTE 順序（L R C LFE Ls Rs…）：按 SMPTE 順序，它的環繞聲會顯示在前方。除非已在其 I/O 設定中重新映射，請在「音訊 MIDI 設定」中設定它的揚聲器，或選擇「聲道順序 ▸ 電影」，並選擇與其輸出匯流排相符的格式。";
"Routes every channel of this format at once: as the device's speakers are set up in Audio MIDI Setup, or in a host's channel order" = "一次路由此格式的所有聲道：按裝置在「音訊 MIDI 設定」中的揚聲器設定，或按某個宿主的聲道順序";
"SMPTE / ITU: L R C LFE Ls Rs…" = "SMPTE / ITU：L R C LFE Ls Rs…";
