/* Radiant body (build 101) */
"Radiant body" = "輝光能量體";
"Radiant body places sound by" = "輝光能量體放置聲音的依據";
"Radiant body draws each band where its frequencies are heard, at the centre of gravity of the speakers that carry them weighted by their level in each, as one glowing body: a centred phantom gathers between L and R, a wide stereo programme stretches along the line between them, and sound all round gathers toward the listener. It glows in the frequencies' hues, burns toward white where it is dense and loud, and swells into haze as it ages. Point lights over it mark exactly where each band's frequencies sit. Level body draws the level heard from each direction as the radius of one body, read on the floor's dBFS rings." = "輝光能量體把每個頻段畫在其頻率被聽到的位置，即承載這些頻率的揚聲器的重心（按各揚聲器中的電平加權），合成一個發光的能量體：居中的幻象聲像聚在 L 與 R 之間，寬廣的立體聲節目沿兩者之間的連線展開，來自四周的聲音向聽者聚攏。它以頻率的色相發光，密集且響亮處趨向白色，隨時間推移散成薄霧。其上的光點準確標出每個頻段的頻率所在之處。電平能量體則把每個方向聽到的電平畫成一個能量體的半徑，可在地面的 dBFS 圓環上讀取。";
"How bright and dense the body glows." = "能量體發光的亮度與密度。";
"How far below the loudest band frequencies still add to the body, in dB: the loudest burn white, quieter ones fade out over this range. How loud the loudest band is sets how dense the whole body is. Hover over the body to read a band's level." = "比最響頻段低多少 dB 以內的頻率仍計入能量體：最響的燒成白色，較弱的在這個範圍內漸隱。最響頻段有多響決定整個能量體的密度。將指標停留在能量體上可讀取頻段的電平。";
"How large each new particle's light is in the body: larger merges neighbouring places into one mass, smaller keeps them apart." = "每個新粒子的光在能量體中有多大：越大越會把相鄰的位置融成一團，越小越能把它們分開。";
"How much light swells as it ages, so older light turns to haze while new light stays compact. 0 keeps it as compact as when it was heard." = "光隨時間推移擴散的程度：較舊的光化為薄霧，新的光保持緊湊。0 讓它保持被聽到時的緊湊。";
"Frequency colors the body by the frequencies heard at each place, warm bass through cool treble: where many bands meet it burns toward a cream-white core, and its fringes show what dominates there. Theme draws it in the palette's color. A split into 3 or 5 bands always shows each band in its own color." = "「頻率」按每個位置聽到的頻率為能量體著色，低音偏暖、高音偏冷：多個頻段交匯處趨向乳白色的核心，邊緣顯示該處佔主導的頻段。「主題」使用調色盤的顏色。分為 3 或 5 個頻段時，每個頻段始終以自身的顏色顯示。";
"Draws the analysis' observations as points instead of the body, for checking where sound is placed: the newest frame only, every point the same small size, without smear, glow or depth shading." = "以點代替能量體繪製分析的觀測值，用於檢查聲音被放在哪裡：只顯示最新一幀，每個點大小相同且很小，沒有拖尾、輝光或深度陰影。";
"How readily speakers that share coherent energy count as one image. In Radiant body it decides what reads as a phantom image or out of phase (the ochre tint and the pointer's reading), not where the body sits: its frequencies' amplitudes decide that. Coherence is measured from the speakers' smoothed cross-spectra and corrected for chance. The analysis uses it (in the plugin, too)." = "共享相干能量的揚聲器被視為同一聲像的難易程度。在輝光能量體中，它決定哪些能量讀作幻象聲像或反相（赭色與指標讀數），而不決定能量體的位置：位置由其頻率的幅度決定。相干度由揚聲器的平滑互譜測得，並校正了偶然相關。分析過程會使用此設定（外掛中也是）。";
"The quietest band drawn: a band below it adds nothing to the body, whatever the glow range." = "繪製的最安靜的頻段：低於它的頻段無論輝光範圍如何都不計入能量體。";
"How long light stays in the body, fading and swelling as it goes; the longer, the more it builds up into a trail of where sound has been." = "光在能量體中停留的時間，期間逐漸淡出並擴散；越長，越會累積成聲音經過之處的軌跡。";
"A glowing body of the speaker feeds' frequency bands, each where its band is heard: at the centre of gravity of the speakers that carry it, weighted by its level in each. A centred phantom gathers between two speakers, a wide stereo programme stretches along the line between them, sound all round gathers toward the listener. The loudest band burns white and quieter ones fade out %d dB below it; older light swells into haze. Point lights mark exactly where each band's frequencies sit. Energy out of phase is tinted ochre. Speakers stand where the speaker layout puts them (the standard one puts every height at 45 degrees)." = "由揚聲器饋送各頻段構成的發光能量體，每個頻段位於它被聽到的位置：承載它的揚聲器的重心，按其在各揚聲器中的電平加權。居中的幻象聲像聚在兩支揚聲器之間，寬廣的立體聲節目沿兩者之間的連線展開，來自四周的聲音向聽者聚攏。最響的頻段燒成白色，較弱的在其下 %d dB 處漸隱；較舊的光散成薄霧。光點準確標出每個頻段的頻率所在之處。反相能量呈赭色。揚聲器位於揚聲器佈局指定的位置（標準佈局把所有頂部揚聲器放在 45 度）。";
"The body wears the colors of the frequencies at each place, warm for bass and cool for treble; where many bands meet, their light adds up toward white." = "能量體帶有每個位置上頻率的顏色，低音偏暖、高音偏冷；多個頻段交匯處，光疊加趨向白色。";
"This plugin sends no frequencies of its own (before build 87), so Radiant body draws from the spatial field's statistics. Install the plugins of this build to see each frequency where it is heard." = "此外掛不傳送自己的頻率（早於 build 87），因此輝光能量體根據空間場的統計資料繪製。安裝此版本的外掛即可在每個頻率被聽到的位置看到它。";
"Points" = "光點";
"How bright the point lights over the body are: each is one place where a band's frequencies are heard, crisp when new and smearing as it ages, so where every band sits can be read exactly. The body dims a little under them, so they carry the brightest light. 0 shows the body alone." = "能量體上光點的亮度：每個光點是一個頻段的頻率被聽到的位置，新出現時清晰，隨時間推移拖尾，因此能準確讀出每個頻段的位置。光點下的能量體會稍微變暗，讓光點承載最亮的光。0 只顯示能量體。";

